baba yeh musalma mujhe rone nahi dete matam<br>
tera zindaan mein hone nahi dete<br>
<br>
1. bistar tera seena tha jisse cheen liya hain<br>
ab god mein madar ke bhi sone nahi dete<br>
<br>
2. ehsaas-e-yateemi mujhe zindaan me huwa hai<br>
main khaak pe soti hu toh sone nahi dete<br>
<br>
3. hai aag ke maanind hai sajjad ke zewar<br>
zanjeer juda tan se ye hone nahi dete<br>
<br>
4. zaalim ke tamachon se lahoo behta hai baba<br>
ashkon se yeh ruksaar bhi dhone nahi dete<br>
<br>
5. thak jaate hain sajjad toh baba tere khaatil<br>
bimaar mere bhai ko sone nahi dete<br>
<br>
6. marjaongi zindan ke andhere mein sisak kar<br>
roti hu toh zalim mujhe rone nahi dete